創造價值。"},{"en":"We believe that our solid results of operations and financial position for 2025 resulted from our continued focus on our strategy to drive the full potential of our core businesses, leverage opportunities across our enterprise, and actively manage our portfolio.","zh":"我們相信，我們 2025 年穩健的經營業績和財務狀況得益於我們繼續專注於充分發揮核心業務潛力、利用整個企業的機會並積極管理我們的投資組合的策略。"},{"en":"In 2025, we continued to return value to our shareholders by repurchasing approximately 8.5 million shares of our common stock and increasing our quarterly dividend by approximately seven percent compared to 2024.","zh":"2025 年，我們透過回購約 850 萬股普通股，並將季度股利較 2024 年增加約 7%，繼續為股東回報價值。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We report our financial results in two segments, our Plumbing Products segment and our Decorative Architectural Products segment, which are aggregated by product similarity. Our Decorative Architectural Products segment is impacted by seasonality and normally experiences stronger sales during the second and third calendar quarters, corresponding with the peak season for repair and remodel activity.","zh":"我們報告兩個部門的財務業績，即管道產品部門和裝飾建築產品部門，這兩個部門按產品相似性匯總。我們的裝飾建築產品部門受到季節性的影響，通常在第二和第三季銷售強勁，這與維修和改造活動的旺季相對應。"},{"en":"Our plumbing products include faucets, showerheads, handheld showers, valves, bath hardware and accessories, bathing units, shower bases and enclosures, shower drains, steam shower systems, water filtration systems, sinks and kitchen accessories. We primarily sell these products to home center retailers, online retailers, mass merchandisers, wholesalers and distributors that, in turn, sell them to plumbers, building contractors, remodelers, smaller retailers, consumers and homebuilders. The majority of our faucet, bathing and showering products are sold primarily in North America, Europe and China under the brand names DELTA , BRIZO , PEERLESS , HANSGROHE , AXOR , KRAUS , NEWPORT BRASS and WALTEC . Our BRISTAN and HERITAGE products are sold primarily in the United Kingdom.","zh":"我們的管道產品包括水龍頭、淋浴噴頭、手持花灑、閥門、浴室五金及配件、沐浴裝置、淋浴底座和外殼、淋浴排水管、蒸汽淋浴系統、水過濾系統、水槽和廚房配件。我們主要將這些產品銷售給家居中心零售商、線上零售商、量販商、批發商和分銷商，而這些產品又銷售給水管工、建築承包商、改造商、小型零售商、消費者和住宅建築商。我們的大部分水龍頭、沐浴和淋浴產品主要以 DELTA、BRIZO、PEERLESS、HANSGROHE、AXOR、KRAUS、NEWPORT BRASS 和 WALTEC 品牌在北美、歐洲和中國銷售。我們的 BRISTAN 和 HERITAGE 產品主要在英國銷售。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our Decorative Architectural Products segment primarily includes architectural coatings, including paints, primers, specialty coatings, stains and waterproofing products, as well as paint applicators and accessories. These products are sold primarily in North America as well as in South America under the brand names BEHR , KILZ , WHIZZ and other trademarks to \"do it yourself\" and professional customers through home center retailers and other retailers. Net sales of architectural coatings comprised approximately 31 percent of our consolidated net sales in 2025 and 32 percent of our consolidated net sales in 2024 and 2023. Our BEHR products are sold through The Home Depot, our largest customer overall, as well as this segment's largest customer. Our Behr business grants to The Home Depot Behr brand exclusivity in the retail sales channel in North America and exclusivity with respect to Kil","zh":"我們的裝飾建築產品部門主要包括建築塗料，包括油漆、底漆、特殊塗料、著色劑和防水產品，以及塗漆器和配件。這些產品主要在北美和南美以 BEHR 、 KILZ 、 WHIZ 和其他商標銷售，透過家居中心零售商和其他零售商向「自己動手做」和專業客戶銷售。建築塗料的淨銷售額約占我們 2025 年合併淨銷售額的 31%，占我們 2024 年和 2023 年合併淨銷售額的 32%。我們的 BEHR 產品透過家得寶 (The Home Depot) 銷售，家得寶是我們最大的客戶，也是該細分市場的最大客戶。我們的 Behr 業務賦予 The Home Depot Behr 品牌在北美零售通路的獨家經營權以及 Kil 的獨家經營權"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Plumbing Products","val":4992000000,"zh":"水暖產品"},{"name":"Decorative Architectural Products","val":2570000000,"zh":"裝飾建築產品"}],"total":7562000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5950000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1612000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":7562000000}},"peers":["MHK","IFF","IR","MLM","RHI"]}}